    <div className="space-y-2 text-xs">
      <p className="text-slate-400">Dedicated servers are <b>non-refundable</b>. This is only for <b>our</b> billing errors or something we did not deliver. It credits the customer&apos;s wallet (never the card), is capped at what was paid (${(capCents / 100).toFixed(2)} left), and is audited.</p>
